What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/kmalloc_used
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only OnePlus allocator summary consumed by Athena and the
		Performance AIDL service.  Each line contains a kmalloc object size
		and the live normal/reclaimable slab allocation in KiB.

What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/vmalloc_used
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only total number of KiB currently tracked by vmalloc.

What:		/proc/oplus_healthinfo/swappiness_para
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	KAI-Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		OnePlus reclaim-policy tuple used by Athena and Performance AIDL.
		Reads report vm_swappiness, direct_swappiness, and
		swapd_swappiness.  Writes accept one matching key with a value from
		0 through 200.  Until the separate HybridSwap subsystem is ported,
		swapd_swappiness controls H.40's native kswapd policy.
